{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：07:46 2026-11-11 HKT</p>\n<p>旺角發生火警。今日（11日）早上7時10分，新填地街316至320號永福大樓一住宅單位，據報有電腦火牛起火冒煙。消防接報到場，動用一條喉及一隊煙帽隊灌救，至早上7時39分將火救熄。</p>\n<p>起火單位的一名24歲男子吸入濃煙不適，由救護車送往廣華醫院治理。另外大廈一名44歲男住客和一名41歲女住客亦感不適，兩人即場在救護車上接受治理後，拒絕送院。火警中共有14男11女疏散。人員經調查後，相信是單位有電腦充電時起火釀禍，案件沒可疑。所有住客其後各自返回自己的單位。</p>\n<img alt=\"一名男子被送上救護車接受治理。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/07180d0442258036324558bf197fb7e1/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-10_at_23_32_56.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"有居民被送上救護車。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/e6f86e9ed0205ae42a6110ed1d0c8fbf/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-11_at_07_47_13.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"有居民帶同寵物逃生。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/06f84b679689da7d9a833b48f3a31778/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-11_at_07_52_19.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"有居民帶同寵物逃生。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/ca1a3a92f8ef0d1d6577f2f267b74b60/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-11_at_07_51_56_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"消防到場灌救。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/0033696b46feab546bf493aa049ad91a/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-11_at_07_48_39_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/467645d9a1a9386bc6501b2ede68d4c7/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-11_at_07_48_38_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"警員怕女童着涼，借出風褸給她穿上。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/38c9bf6525a45745dc89c98b84e96a7b/2026-11/11_0_2.jpeg\"/>\n<p>居於大廈3樓的姓夏小學四年級女生，事後猶有餘悸講述走火警經過。她哭訴火警發生時她「好驚」，有人拍門並突然有消防員「衝咗入嚟」，她於是告知姐姐，「姐姐即刻叫我走，之後叫埋哥哥走」。她逃生後警員怕她着涼，亦借出風褸給她穿上。</p>\n<p>現場所見，大廈搭有棚架及圍網，有居民帶同寵物逃生。火警期間，新填地街與登打士街暫時封閉。</p>\n<img alt=\"居民疏散。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/1daf92b4ee26d9ebbedcc5af8e202fe2/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-11_at_07_48_39.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/c585c9302a745eefa61ee766af16ebfb/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-11_at_07_48_38.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"大廈搭有棚架及圍網。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/7218a4fbcdc5345d75094c0febda95a2/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-11_at_07_48_37.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"居民走火警逃生。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/27371ab5d22eee98006e2cb39d8b9e04/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-11_at_08_02_13.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/70044c1a79b87ca3f3887491c50d298a/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-11_at_08_02_12_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/286e4c192d0f8303b4446405abdea7e3/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-11_at_08_02_12_1_.jpeg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T07:45:18.375671+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":410,"images":13,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T03:54:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T07:38:55.391546+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T07:38:55.391546+00:00","content_hash":"697b132901d9697cae43b4f59df0f244d1af32d6c02a98f0a66f46bde0779d48","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}